WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.140 --> 00:00:04.660
Speaker 1: I want to make a goal of mine publicly
known so that you can hold me to it.

00:00:04.660 --> 00:00:09.200
You know, one of the best ways to actually
get something done is to tell other people

00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:10.920
that you plan to do it.

00:00:10.920 --> 00:00:15.520
And my goal is to stop explaining myself to
idiots.

00:00:15.520 --> 00:00:18.119
Now you might say, Well, whoa, sir, that's
very aggressive language.

00:00:18.119 --> 00:00:19.240
What do you mean?

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:25.669
In order to try to save myself from thousands
of horrible comments, tweets and emails, I

00:00:25.669 --> 00:00:29.919
will often over explain things and give disclaimers.

00:00:29.919 --> 00:00:36.500
And I really am only doing that to people
who are just nuts or our bad faith actors.

00:00:36.500 --> 00:00:41.680
So like when I say, Hey guys, you know, in
the in the Russia Ukraine thing, Putin's the

00:00:41.680 --> 00:00:42.680
aggressor.

00:00:42.680 --> 00:00:45.190
But to be clear, I don't support American
imperialism.

00:00:45.190 --> 00:00:49.429
I don't think the U.S. is a perfect actor
with an unblemished record of foreign foreign

00:00:49.429 --> 00:00:50.429
relations.

00:00:50.429 --> 00:00:52.129
I do not favor the U.S. sending troops to
Ukraine.

00:00:52.129 --> 00:00:55.030
I do not think the U.S. should choose the
leaders in other countries.

00:00:55.030 --> 00:00:59.210
And all of those disclaimers are really for
like five percent of my audience.

00:00:59.210 --> 00:01:03.499
Now I wish it was like one percent or less,
but it is about five percent of the audience,

00:01:03.499 --> 00:01:06.000
but it's a very loud five percent.

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:08.750
It's a very weaponized five percent.

00:01:08.750 --> 00:01:15.280
But most of you know that I don't mean invade
Russia when I say Putin is being the aggressor

00:01:15.280 --> 00:01:16.280
here.

00:01:16.280 --> 00:01:24.060
And likewise, when I say, you know, I can't
support the former Chavez now Maduro regime

00:01:24.060 --> 00:01:29.369
in Venezuela because they've raped and pillage
the country's resources for themselves while

00:01:29.369 --> 00:01:33.130
spewing false populist rhetoric about how
they're going to help everybody.

00:01:33.130 --> 00:01:37.880
And meanwhile, people can't even afford food,
which there are shortages of anyway.

00:01:37.880 --> 00:01:40.460
I don't mean invade Venezuela.

00:01:40.460 --> 00:01:42.440
I don't mean assassinate Maduro.

00:01:42.440 --> 00:01:46.860
I don't mean that the U.S. should pick who
is the leader in Venezuela.

00:01:46.860 --> 00:01:52.600
I only mean, I don't like Maduro. 95 percent
of you get that.

00:01:52.600 --> 00:01:58.070
But the five percent that don't or refuse
to are really loud and really annoying.

00:01:58.070 --> 00:01:59.900
But this isn't normal.

00:01:59.900 --> 00:02:05.680
This isn't a normal way to talk about things,
and this is sadly a toxic reality of the internet.

00:02:05.680 --> 00:02:09.019
This is kind of like how Twitter works in
social media.

00:02:09.019 --> 00:02:17.370
All these platforms select and and highlight
reactionaries and outrageous responses to

00:02:17.370 --> 00:02:18.370
content.

00:02:18.370 --> 00:02:20.060
I'll give you kind of like a benign example.

00:02:20.060 --> 00:02:26.959
I post a picture of myself having a cappuccino
at a coffee shop in Los Angeles the way I

00:02:26.959 --> 00:02:28.300
did two months ago.

00:02:28.300 --> 00:02:30.310
This was on Instagram, not Twitter.

00:02:30.310 --> 00:02:35.879
99 percent of the people who see me with my
stupid cappuccino say nothing.

00:02:35.879 --> 00:02:40.370
I never hear from 99 percent of the people
who see that picture.

00:02:40.370 --> 00:02:42.500
One percent leave a comment.

00:02:42.500 --> 00:02:46.190
90 percent of the comments are completely
normal.

00:02:46.190 --> 00:02:47.920
Weather looks great.

00:02:47.920 --> 00:02:48.920
Looks great.

00:02:48.920 --> 00:02:50.710
Have fun yet whatever of the comments.

00:02:50.710 --> 00:02:55.780
OK, so we're talking 10 percent of the one
percent the people who choose to comment of

00:02:55.780 --> 00:02:56.830
those comments.

00:02:56.830 --> 00:02:57.909
10 percent.

00:02:57.909 --> 00:02:59.650
People go crazy.

00:02:59.650 --> 00:03:03.130
David, you're traveling during a pandemic.

00:03:03.130 --> 00:03:04.540
You're so irresponsible.

00:03:04.540 --> 00:03:05.590
How dare you?

00:03:05.590 --> 00:03:08.370
You know, people died of COVID today.

00:03:08.370 --> 00:03:09.580
The other one.

00:03:09.580 --> 00:03:12.390
You're not wearing a mask, David, sit.

00:03:12.390 --> 00:03:15.950
You don't you don't care about other people.

00:03:15.950 --> 00:03:21.840
You're so self-centered that you drink a cappuccino
with no mask and No.

00:03:21.840 --> 00:03:23.040
Three.

00:03:23.040 --> 00:03:25.450
Are you drinking cow's milk?

00:03:25.450 --> 00:03:26.980
How were you not a vegan?

00:03:26.980 --> 00:03:29.540
You're a terrible person.

00:03:29.540 --> 00:03:30.540
It's not normal.

00:03:30.540 --> 00:03:36.080
And social media really skews this because
most people see a guy with a coffee and they

00:03:36.080 --> 00:03:37.629
move on with their day.

00:03:37.629 --> 00:03:43.050
But the internet has created this almost defensive
status quo for posting anything.

00:03:43.050 --> 00:03:46.860
And on my show, I'm in this defensive mode.

00:03:46.860 --> 00:03:53.110
Whenever I comment on stuff, even though anybody
normal or acting in good faith realizes these

00:03:53.110 --> 00:04:00.409
are not normal reactions and that I'm not
saying whatever the worst faith possible interpretation

00:04:00.409 --> 00:04:02.560
of my words actually is.

00:04:02.560 --> 00:04:09.040
So my new effort is going to be not to do
the disclaimers and the defensiveness when

00:04:09.040 --> 00:04:11.829
I just give my opinion about things on the
show.

00:04:11.829 --> 00:04:17.470
Because at the end of the day, not only is
it preposterous to cater to people who are,

00:04:17.470 --> 00:04:20.390
quite frankly, nuts or bad faith actors.

00:04:20.390 --> 00:04:23.610
It also won't stop them from saying the exact
same things.

00:04:23.610 --> 00:04:25.740
And I've got an example for you.

00:04:25.740 --> 00:04:30.360
Look at the comments on my recent Russia clips
in those videos.

00:04:30.360 --> 00:04:35.430
I say Putin is the aggressor, but I'm not
an imperialist.

00:04:35.430 --> 00:04:37.200
I don't want war.

00:04:37.200 --> 00:04:39.220
I don't want U.S. troops there.

00:04:39.220 --> 00:04:43.700
I don't want U.S. involvement beyond, you
know, if Naito as an organization, says, Well,

00:04:43.700 --> 00:04:46.180
we're going to support Ukraine in some way.

00:04:46.180 --> 00:04:51.400
I don't want the U.S. doing regime change,
and I look at the video and I see comments

00:04:51.400 --> 00:04:55.200
like the ones I'm putting up on the screen
for you right now.

00:04:55.200 --> 00:04:59.290
You're just repeating establishment talking
points and neocon lies.

00:04:59.290 --> 00:05:00.290
David.

00:05:00.290 --> 00:05:04.460
I'm not imperialist, but let's have war now.

00:05:04.460 --> 00:05:07.390
I did the disclaimers and I still got the
comment.

00:05:07.390 --> 00:05:08.390
Next comment.

00:05:08.390 --> 00:05:10.180
You are an imperialist.

00:05:10.180 --> 00:05:12.480
No, no, no.

00:05:12.480 --> 00:05:14.080
I explained it.

00:05:14.080 --> 00:05:15.170
Another comment.

00:05:15.170 --> 00:05:19.300
Tulsi is a twisted grifter, but you're brazenly
lying.

00:05:19.300 --> 00:05:23.640
Warmongering imperialist trash, David.

00:05:23.640 --> 00:05:27.390
I'm going to do my best because either way,
they're going to say that stuff.

00:05:27.390 --> 00:05:33.020
So at the end of the day, I don't do the show
for that crazy five percent.

00:05:33.020 --> 00:05:36.850
I'm doing the show for the good faith, 95
percent.

00:05:36.850 --> 00:05:41.970
So the other five percent can, quite frankly,
you know, go go to wherever.

00:05:41.970 --> 00:05:42.970
Hold me to it.

00:05:42.970 --> 00:05:43.970
Keep me honest.

00:05:43.970 --> 00:05:44.870
OK, I appreciate that.

